name: Bounded manual decision saves and input ownership
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py prepare @TARGET @ART/fixture
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 30 rows 1-500 of 1000 | first-page
submit: open F-0952
require-live-snap: 20 Synthetic Review candidate 0000 | selected
wait: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py start-contention @TARGET @ART/fixture
submit: decision deferred J103 wide
require-live-snap: 10 saving F-0952 | saving-wide
expect-echo-within: 300 wide-save-draft
live-snap: wide-draft
expect: wide-save-draft
ask: Does the pending save remain distinct from the recorded verdict while typing keeps ownership of the composer and selected finding?
keys: C-u
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 wide | saved-wide
resize: 160x48
wait: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py start-contention @TARGET @ART/fixture
submit: decision confirmed J103 rail
require-live-snap: 10 saving F-0952 | saving-rail
expect: scope: F-0952
expect-echo-within: 300 rail-save-draft
live-snap: rail-draft
keys: C-u
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 rail | saved-rail
ask: At 160 columns, do rail and detail agree on identity and show the actual recorded result without moving focus?
resize: 96x89
wait: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py start-contention @TARGET @ART/fixture
submit: decision deferred J103 tall
require-live-snap: 10 saving F-0952 | saving-tall
expect-echo-within: 300 tall-save-draft
live-snap: tall-draft
keys: C-u
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 tall | saved-tall
resize: 80x24
wait: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py start-contention @TARGET @ART/fixture
submit: decision confirmed J103 medium
require-live-snap: 10 saving F-0952 | saving-medium
expect-echo-within: 300 medium-save-draft
live-snap: medium-draft
keys: C-u
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 confirmed | saved-medium
resize: 60x20
wait: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py start-contention @TARGET @ART/fixture
submit: decision deferred J103 narrow
require-live-snap: 10 saving F-0952 | saving-narrow
expect-echo-within: 300 narrow-save-draft
live-snap: narrow-draft
keys: C-u
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 deferred | saved-narrow
ask: At 80 and 60 columns, are pending and recorded states readable with the intended alias and usable navigation?
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py start-contention @TARGET @ART/fixture
type: decision confirmed J103 tiny
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 10 saving F-0952 | saving-tiny
expect-echo-within: 300 tiny-save-draft
live-snap: tiny-draft
expect: tiny-save-draft
ask: At 40x12, does the save label retain the finding identity while the complete draft stays editable?
keys: C-u
wait: 1
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 tiny | saved-tiny
submit: dismiss false_positive J103 false positive
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 false positive | false-positive
submit: decision confirmed J103 restored
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 restored | restored
ask: Can an explicit human decision supersede the false-positive decision while preserving both records and observation evidence?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: open F-0952
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 J103 restored | restart-recorded
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/large_review.py verify-manual-decisions @TARGET @ART/fixture
ask: Does no-color restart show the durable final decision and source evidence, backed by exactly eight explicit writes on one identity and no new observations or model calls?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
